Package: pc-config
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, default-dbus-system-bus | dbus-system-bus, kmod, systemd (>= 252), udev (>= 252)
Description: AMD hardware watchdog settings for a Linux workstation
 Loads the sp5100_tco driver during normal startup and configures systemd
 to keep its hardware watchdog alive with a five-minute timeout.
